        "console_io_tutorial::captured_async_callbacks_use_the_same_facade_and_dependency_errors_keep_their_source",
        "artisan_docs_generated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "native": "CommandIo terminal streaming",
      "reason": "沿用write_raw；终端及时写入且不缓存整段历史，Output::default按原行为捕获文本；组件pending在下一次实时写入前按序发出",
      "evidence": [
        "console_io_tutorial::live_binary_emits_before_completion_and_nested_components_keep_order_without_duplication"
      ]
    },
